{"id":"30dce33330cca251","group":"93","path":"93/93-ex-congruence-permutable.md","title":"Permutable Example","display":"Permutable Example","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-ex-congruence-permutable","aliases":["93-ex-congruence-permutable"],"display":"Permutable Example","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-congruence]]","[[93-df-permutable]]","[[93-thm-malcev-term]]","[[93-df-group]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-ex-congruence-permutable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-ex-congruence-permutable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Permutable Example"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"30b341bfbd8b5301\" href=\"?note=30b341bfbd8b5301\" title=\"93-df-congruence\">93-df-congruence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b4de3484ad8d9669\" href=\"?note=b4de3484ad8d9669\" title=\"93-df-permutable\">93-df-permutable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"172be99586e3e75f\" href=\"?note=172be99586e3e75f\" title=\"93-thm-malcev-term\">93-thm-malcev-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"eb9dce8251e2dc37\" href=\"?note=eb9dce8251e2dc37\" title=\"93-df-group\">93-df-group</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"ex-congruence-permutable---Permutable-Example\">ex-congruence-permutable - Permutable Example</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Group}_{93}(\\mathbf G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Group}_{93}(\\mathbf G)\\)</span> is the sourced group predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"eb9dce8251e2dc37\" href=\"?note=eb9dce8251e2dc37\" title=\"93-df-group\">93-df-group</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf{G})\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf{G})\\)</span> is the congruence lattice of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{G}\">\\(\\mathbf{G}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Permutable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Permutable}\\)</span> is the typed congruence-permutability predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b4de3484ad8d9669\" href=\"?note=b4de3484ad8d9669\" title=\"93-df-permutable\">93-df-permutable</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Group}_{93}(\\mathbf G)\\to\n\\forall\\theta,\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf G)\\;\n\\mathrm{Permutable}(\\theta,\\phi;\\mathbf G).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Group}_{93}(\\mathbf G)\\to\n\\forall\\theta,\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf G)\\;\n\\mathrm{Permutable}(\\theta,\\phi;\\mathbf G).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Groups form a congruence-permutable variety with Malcev term\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(x,y,z) = x y^{-1} z\">\\(p(x,y,z) = x y^{-1} z\\)</span>. More generally, all varieties of groups,\nrings, and modules have permutable congruences.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"ex-congruence-permutable---Permutable-Example","text":"ex-congruence-permutable - Permutable Example","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-congruence","status":"resolved","id":"30b341bfbd8b5301","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-congruence]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-permutable","status":"resolved","id":"b4de3484ad8d9669","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-permutable]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-thm-malcev-term","status":"resolved","id":"172be99586e3e75f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-thm-malcev-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-group","status":"resolved","id":"eb9dce8251e2dc37","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-group]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-group","status":"resolved","id":"eb9dce8251e2dc37","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Group}_{93}(\\mathbf G)$ is the sourced group predicate of [[93-df-group]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-permutable","status":"resolved","id":"b4de3484ad8d9669","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Permutable}$ is the typed congruence-permutability predicate of [[93-df-permutable]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Group}_{93}(\\mathbf G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf{G})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{G}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Permutable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Group}_{93}(\\mathbf G)\\to\n\\forall\\theta,\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf G)\\;\n\\mathrm{Permutable}(\\theta,\\phi;\\mathbf G).","display":true},{"tex":"p(x,y,z) = x y^{-1} z","display":false}],"bytes":1023,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["30b341bfbd8b5301","b4de3484ad8d9669","172be99586e3e75f","eb9dce8251e2dc37"]}